        "For a Tuljapur student the regional pull runs towards Pune, with Savitribai Phule Pune University, COEP Technological University, Symbiosis and MIT World Peace University; towards Mumbai, with IIT Bombay and the colleges of the University of Mumbai; and towards Hyderabad, with the University of Hyderabad and IIIT Hyderabad. Solapur and Dharashiv offer closer college and hospital options, and the colleges in Tuljapur serve students who would rather stay at home.",
